<title>USA: Cirrus Logic raises $300 mln.</title>
<headline>Cirrus Logic raises $300 mln.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cirrus Logic Inc Wednesday said it completed an offering of $300 million aggregate principle amount of convertible subordinated notes.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said the offering was expanded from $175 million due to strong investor demand.</p>
<p>The notes bear interest at 6.0 percent, mature in December 2003, and are convertible into shares of Cirrus Logic common stock at $24.2188 per share.  The company said the proceeds from this placement will be used for general corporate purposes, including general working capital, investments in manufacturing, and retirement of bank line borrowings.</p>
</text>
